E         +
E         +**§60.1 Entering findings.** Phase 149O.20L.7O.2H.1 independently
E         +demonstrated two Blocking defects in v1.5: `core/paths.py` was reached
E         +by limb (d) authority paths but absent from HMIC-REQ-050, and current
E         +HMIC-REQ-076 still described a four-contract creation ceremony despite
E         +HMIC-REQ-067/069 and the repaired `CertificationRecord` schema requiring
E         +exactly seven. This section records only the narrow repairs; it does not
E         +independently verify them or authorize certification.
