E         +**§60.2 Symbol-level source closure.** The AG3 chain is
E         +`production_sign_rollback_evidence` → `sign_rollback_evidence` →
E         +`resolve_signing_context` → `_resolve_ag3_operation` →
E         +`build_rollback_review` → `HarnessPath.join` → the live
E         +`.pcae/remote/jobs/<job_id>.json` record → `original_commit_sha`. The
E         +AG5 sibling is `resolve_signing_context` → `_resolve_ag5_operation` →
E         +`lookup_promotion_execution_record` → `HarnessPath.path` → the live
E         +promotion-execution record → `ecp_id`. Those record fields enter the
E         +canonical signing context before confirmation and hardware touch.
E         +Changing only `paths.py` can redirect either lookup without changing a
E         +v1.5 frozen byte. `core/paths.py` is therefore authority-bearing under
E         +HMIC-REQ-052(d), not a neutral value type, and joins HMIC-REQ-050
E         +unchanged.
