E         +**§60.3 Prior-exclusion root cause and remaining leaves.** §59.5
E         +substituted a whole-module “generic utility” label and prior exclusion
E         +precedent for symbol-level behavioral closure. An imported dependency
E         +is not absorbed by the caller's own byte binding: if its reached symbol
E         +can select a signing input, its own bytes must be bound. The narrow
E         +recheck does not overturn the other three leaves. `provenance.py` is
E         +called by the two enrollment writers only after the authority mutation
E         +and durable readback, to append audit evidence; its reached
E         +`git_status.read_git_branch` and `tasks.find_latest_active_task` calls
E         +populate audit metadata only. None gates, selects, or changes a
E         +credential, Principal, Signer, signing context, provider, publication,
